without asking!

17:12.240 --> 17:16.702
This ain't good... At this rate, both Daten
City and the whole damn Earth is doomed.

17:16.703 --> 17:19.538
W-What should we do?

17:19.539 --> 17:26.212
And can you not eat the flan
I was looking forward to eating

17:26.588 --> 17:29.424
after my bath!

17:34.429 --> 17:37.140
Fuck off!

17:37.640 --> 17:39.683
More importantly...

17:39.684 --> 17:42.687
where the hell is my favorite vibrator?

17:43.521 --> 17:48.193
You think I wouldn't
notice you jacked it?

17:49.027 --> 17:50.737
You slimy bitch!

17:51.821 --> 17:53.615
That's rich coming from you.

17:54.199 --> 17:56.742
What about you

17:56.743 --> 17:59.703
pay me back those five Daten City dollars
I lent you?

17:59.704 --> 18:02.289
Quit flipping out over petty
crap, you cheap bitch!

18:02.290 --> 18:07.461
Calling a bitch a "bitch" doesn't make me
the bitch... it makes you the bigger bitch!

18:07.462 --> 18:10.632
Stocking, you ultra super

18:11.549 --> 18:16.261
mega bitch scum!

18:16.262 --> 18:18.514
No, Panty!

18:18.515 --> 18:21.518
You're going to kill Stocking!

18:25.021 --> 18:27.524
You gigabitch

18:28.274 --> 18:29.818
scum.

18:30.860 --> 18:34.614
Terabitch scum!

18:37.450 --> 18:38.909
Stop fucking hiding

18:38.910 --> 18:42.622
and come on out, Stocking!

18:43.957 --> 18:48.378
You're being such a brat, Panty!

18:49.712 --> 18:52.715
- Don't push your fucking luck, Stocking!
- Panty!

18:53.341 --> 18:55.717
Well, your mama's got an outie!

18:55.718 --> 18:57.929
Then so does your mom!

18:58.346 --> 18:59.805
Ugly fucking Panty!

18:59.806 --> 19:03.267
Shut up, Stocking!
You're the ugly one calling people ugly!

19:03.268 --> 19:07.604
Feat your eyes, Brief... this
is what I call peak bitchery.

19:07.605 --> 19:11.484
Yeah, this is what I'm talking about!
This is the Panty I love!

19:12.819 --> 19:14.820
It seems the medication is wearing off.

19:14.821 --> 19:16.363
You're alive?

19:16.364 --> 19:20.410
I can't stay asleep with
these vulgar profanities.

19:29.335 --> 19:33.840
Quit screwin' around already, you
stupid-ass angels! It is time to go home.

19:34.132 --> 19:36.425
- But Garter!
- But Garter!

19:36.426 --> 19:39.970
Listen, Garter,
Panty keeps pulling my hair.

19:39.971 --> 19:42.640
What's so wrong with that?
It's just your hair. Take that.

19:48.646 --> 19:50.898
Shit! Totally forgot
I had a bungee sex date

19:50.899 --> 19:53.483
with my fuckbuddy
at the Hyatt on Third Street.

19:53.484 --> 19:56.111
Oops. I've got plans
for a 4K revival Dolby version

19:56.112 --> 19:59.406
<i>Guts of a Ghost</i> 4DX cheer screening.

19:59.407 --> 20:01.658
Hey, Garter, I'm skipping dinner tonight.

20:01.659 --> 20:03.369
Me either.

20:04.120 --> 20:06.997
Stocking, I'm driving by the theater.
Wanna ride?

20:06.998 --> 20:09.041
Thanks, that's actually so helpful.

20:09.042 --> 20:11.209
The movie's gonna start soon,
so let's step on it.

20:11.210 --> 20:13.296
Go, See Through, go!

20:17.133 --> 20:19.384
Oh, man. I've had enough of this.

20:19.385 --> 20:21.095
Looks like a good time to skedaddle.

20:21.763 --> 20:26.934
Dearest Sister, I fear there's
nowhere for us to return.

20:26.935 --> 20:31.229
Yeah, and we got caught up
and helped some angels.

20:31.230 --> 20:32.315
You need a place?

20:33.066 --> 20:35.652
Demons, come with me to our home.

20:37.111 --> 20:40.740
Time for me to sneak away back to Hell
and bust out a new plan!

20:42.075 --> 20:44.910
Y'all want a ride if
you're going to the house?

20:44.911 --> 20:46.496
It's on the way.

20:49.040 --> 20:51.333
Is that okay?

20:51.334 --> 20:55.087
We carried the same <i>Mikoshi</i>.
We're already family.

20:55.088 --> 20:56.381
Exactly.

20:57.048 --> 20:58.590
You too.

20:58.591 --> 21:00.093
What? I can come too?

21:03.846 --> 21:06.349
I have a feeling things
are gonna get wild again!

21:07.558 --> 21:09.185
I was almost a goner.

21:11.187 --> 21:15.400
I want <i>monjayaki</i> so bad.

21:16.275 --> 21:19.361
<i>The angels have returned to Daten City,</i>

21:19.362 --> 21:21.447
<i>bringing the Demon sisters along.</i>

21:22.365 --> 21:26.535
<i>In the city between God and demons, let
the names of angels ring who extinguish</i>

21:26.536 --> 21:30.956
<i>evil spirits, infesting the streets,
with their holy, heavenly light.</i>

21:30.957 --> 21:36.295
<i>Panty and Stocking!</i>

21:36.879 --> 21:40.299
<i>Panty and Stocking.</i>

21:42.010 --> 21:44.469
- <i>Panty and Stocking.</i>
- <i>Panty and Stocking.</i>

21:44.470 --> 21:46.097
- <i>Homecoming.</i>
- <i>Homecoming.</i>

23:23.528 --> 23:24.737
Yes.

23:25.530 --> 23:29.282
The arrangements have been made.

23:29.283 --> 23:33.537
Yes, leave everything to me.

23:33.538 --> 23:37.833
Of course. All is under control,
